# Project Structure

The project repository is organised into separate sections to make the project files easy to find.

## Main Sections

- `/docs` - Contains the ERD, Endpoint Plan, SQL Script and supporting project documentation.
- `/README.md` - Provides an overview of the system, user roles, CI/CD validation and demonstration video.
- GitHub Actions workflow - Automatically validates the repository.

## Documentation

The `/docs` folder contains the planning and technical documents used during development.

## Version Control

GitHub is used to track project changes through commits and to maintain the project history.
